title: "AttackAware PolyIoM v1.1.4 — reproducibility package"
version: 1.1.4
date-released: 2026-09-22
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and stored results for a pre-registered evaluation of a cancelable
  biometric scheme that applies a keyed polynomial transform to a face or
  speaker embedding before Index-of-Maximum hashing, reporting all four
  ISO/IEC 24745 criteria at one sealed operating point.
